  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/664/664-7-a.htm",
  "statuteText": "664:7-a Statement Retention. –\n\nStatements or reports required to be filed under RSA 664:6 and 664:7 shall be held in original form for 6 years from the election for which they are filed, after which time they may be destroyed. The secretary of state shall be responsible for the retention of the original form of statements filed using the campaign finance system."
